      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how deeply you feel trapped in that relentless system, and your fear that self-care is just a \"joke\" in the face of that deadly pressure is completely valid.\nThe feeling of being a hollow shell often happens when the very people who give life meaning are the ones chasing the same \"endless goal\" that is killing you.\nI cannot solve your pain, but I hope you know that your pain is a signal that the \"you\" you feel is still right there, even if you can't hear it over the noise.",
