    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just noise. it's like... every single part of my life is just a series of obligations to things that don't matter. i look at what i've built and it's just a tomb. i'm tired of fighting to keep this version of myself alive when there's nothing actually living inside anymore. sometimes i just wish i could experience actual, total silence. just a way to finally be still and stop performing.",
